_tag\" >Customize Your Nightmare </h2>Unlock a range of chilling skins to apply to the Mannequins as you find hidden items. <br>Unlock multiple difficulty levels to really change the challenge, with some changing the rules of certain modes.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451140/extras/9ccb56a42d085ea920c793cc69c5398c.poster.avif?t=1690757996\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451140/extras/9ccb56a42d085ea920c793cc69c5398c.webm?t=1690757996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451140/extras/9ccb56a42d085ea920c793cc69c5398c.mp4?t=1690757996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Can you outwit the relentless mannequins that haunt your every move? Can you navigate the treacherous corridors, utilizing surveillance cameras to expose their true selves? Face your fears in Mannequin: The Spotting.",
